# Build context exclusions.
#
# The image copies go.mod, go.sum, cmd/ and internal/, so anything else is only
# sent to the daemon and discarded. .git is the large one: without this, every
# build transfers the whole history and a change to a commit re-invalidates the
# dependency layer's cache.

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Documentation and the local design notes are not compiled in.
*.md
!go.mod
!go.sum
docs/
LICENSE

# Build output and local state, which would otherwise be copied over the fresh
# binaries in the image.
dist/
bin/
/lightningfeed
/lightningfeed-demo
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
data/
tmp/

# Not a build input, and it is where a real .env would live if one were copied in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore